WEBVTT

00:02:25.967 --> 00:02:30.293
Hivyo mazungumzo ya bakteria yanakuwa
na mwanzo na jibu,

00:02:30.317 --> 00:02:33.389
uzalishaji wa molekuli
na majibu yake.

00:02:35.094 --> 00:02:38.434
Kwenye utafiti wangu, nimelenga kupeleleza
kwenye jamii za bakteria

00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:39.861
ndani ya mwili wa binadamu.

00:02:40.343 --> 00:02:41.588
Inafanyaje kazi?

00:02:42.385 --> 00:02:44.300
Tunasampuli kutoka kwa mgonjwa.

00:02:44.324 --> 00:02:46.862
Inaweza kuwa ni sampuli ya damu au mate.

00:02:47.304 --> 00:02:49.841
Tunapiga elektroni ndani ya sampuli,

00:02:49.865 --> 00:02:53.785
elektroni zitaingilia na molekuli
zozote za mazungumzo zilizopo,

00:02:53.809 --> 00:02:56.190
na huu muingiliano utatupa
taarifa

00:02:56.214 --> 00:02:58.105
ya aina ya bakteria,

00:02:58.129 --> 00:02:59.800
aina ya mawasiliano

00:02:59.824 --> 00:03:02.117
na kiasi gani bakteria wanazungumza.